PROMPTS[114]="IMAGINE WHAT 70 BILLION YEARS ON HESTIA LOOKS LIKE label. WE DON'T HAVE THE WORDS FOR IT label. NOT YET label hopeful bold. Stick figure looking through telescope toward stars. Future feeling. Electric blues warm yellows."
PROMPTS[115]="IF THIS VIDEO MADE YOU FEEL SOMETHING LIKE IT AND SUBSCRIBE TO UNKNOWN ORIGINS label. DROP A COMMENT label. DO YOU THINK A PLANET LIKE HESTIA ALREADY EXISTS OUT THERE label. WHAT DO YOU THINK IT PRODUCED label. Stars background."
PROMPTS[116]="Stick figure waving goodbye big happy expression. WE'LL SEE YOU IN THE NEXT ONE label. Stars and Hestia-like planet glowing in background. Warm invid vivid colours. Unknown Origins channel feel."

# Fill remaining to 120 with key visual moments
PROMPTS[117]="HESTIA in enormous glowing letters filling frame. The perfect planet for life. Deep purple space. Stars all around. Orange dwarf star behind it. Golden warm glow. Dramatic reveal. THIS IS HESTIA label bold."
PROMPTS[118]="Scientists designed a planet from scratch. Blueprint of Hestia showing every optimised feature. DESIGNED FOR LIFE label. All features labelled with green ticks. Star oceans continents atmosphere temperature. Complete blueprint."
PROMPTS[119]="Earth vs Hestia final comparison. Earth labelled PRETTY GOOD. Hestia labelled PERFECTLY DESIGNED FOR LIFE. Side by side dramatic comparison. All features compared with arrows. THAT'S THE DIFFERENCE label bold. Vivid dramatic."
PROMPTS[120]="Unknown Origins channel logo with stars and space background. SUBSCRIBE label. EVERY VIDEO IS ANOTHER WORLD label. ANOTHER MYSTERY label. ANOTHER PLACE THE UNIVERSE FORGOT TO MAKE SAFE label. See you next time. Vivid warm."

